<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Navan appoints Brian Calver as new CEO.</title>
<headline>Navan appoints Brian Calver as new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish-based mining and metals exploration company Navan Resources Plc said on Wednesday it had appointed Brian Calver as chief executive officer and managing director from November 3.</p>
<p>It said the current chief executive, Paul Mihalop, would continue as a director of the company.</p>
<p>Navan said Calver was a mining engineer with 32 years of experience in the mining industry. It said he was leaving Sierra Rutile Holdings after three years as chief executive there.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
